§ T27.a pass.odin (400 LOC)
  types : Pass { name kind requires[] preserves[] run }
          Pass_Kind { Analysis, Transform }
          Pass_Stats { ran applied skipped elapsed_ms note }
          Pass_Ctx  { analyses stats opt_level fuel verify_each
                      tc z3_path cvc5_path cache_dir emit_notes
                      live_analyses }
          Pass_Manager { ctx pipeline total_ms }
  pipelines :
    -O0 verifier-only
    -O1 const-fold + dce
    -O2 +cse +smt-prune +inline (default)
    -O3 +partial-eval +fixpoint-inline
  stats-reporters : stats_report_text + stats_report_json
  custom-pipeline : build_custom_pipeline(names) ← --passes=fold,dce

§ T27.b analysis.odin (250 LOC)
  Use_Def : map[^Value]^Op defs + map[^Value][dynamic]Use_Site uses
    usedef_build + usedef_destroy + usedef_uses + usedef_use_count + usedef_is_dead
  Dominance : structured-CFG tree-walk (ancestor-chain)
    op_dominates(a, b) returns true iff a's block is ancestor-of-b-on-tree
  Alias_Info / Escape_Info : conservative stubs ; future-scope
  make_pass_analysis_usedef : Pass wrapper ; get_usedef convenience

§ T27.c-h 6 opt-pass implementations
  opt_const_fold.odin (190 LOC) :
    folds arith + compare + bool ops when all-operands are const
    iterative within a single invocation (up to 16 iters)
    replace-in-place preserves Value identity for downstream use
  opt_dce.odin (110 LOC) :
    removes pure ops with no uses + no side-effects
    preserves terminators + call/effect/refinement/match/store/assume
  opt_cse.odin (145 LOC) :
    hash-cons pure ops within a single block
    key = name + operand-ids + sorted-attrs
    rewires downstream uses from duplicate → first-seen
  opt_inline.odin (190 LOC) :
    inlines single-block small fn-bodies (<=32 ops)
    α-rename via val_map ; fuel-budget from ctx.fuel
    emits cslv3.var_ref alias to replace call-result
  opt_partial_eval.odin (135 LOC) :
    identity-rewrites : x+0→x, x*1→x, x*0→0, x|false→x, x&true→x, etc.
  opt_smt_prune.odin (80 LOC) :
    static const-bool branch pruning
    solver-query wiring ready ; dynamic queries Session-9+

