§ ARCHITECTURE-NOTES-APPLIED
  No-admin solver-install          ← portable + reproducible across machines
  Obligation two-mode system       ← separates self-declared-refinement from
                                     proof-obligation ; fixes semantic mismatch
  Ed25519 audit-chain-verify       ← independent per-entry verification ;
                                     chain-walk returns (ok, n_verified)
  Mode-classified discharge-result ← exit-code semantics clear + strict-safe
  MLIR-style pass-manager          ← flat list + requires/preserves
                                     analysis-invalidation book-keeping
  Structured-CFG dominance O(n)    ← our IR is already tree-shaped ;
                                     op_dominates is ancestor-chain walk
  Budget-bounded fixpoint          ← ctx.fuel prevents unbounded iteration
                                     at O3 ; inline+partial-eval charge against
                                     shared pool
  Graceful-degrade pass-manager    ← no-solver → smt-prune notes & skips ;
                                     pipeline remains valid ; stats accurate
  Golden-diff stability contract   ← O0/O1/O2 byte-stable ; O3 allowed to drift
                                     (per theoretical-note §§ golden-diff)
  Conservative alias/escape stubs  ← infrastructure in place ; Session-9+ can
                                     fill with real analysis

